    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aff65179cb2dbe2741caf52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "坏、坏蛋的证据……？\n风风是对草地没有兴趣吗？\n草地的经典竞赛关注度也很高的说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "919ec29c5f5c7a107089c7bac6df7c9a297f39e69fe603d1dd634a4d08dea00d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
