      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听她这么一说，我也觉得有点好奇。\n“渴望被关注”的她不选择草地的理由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de37e1e743b0c40cd99c7320965f9ba495ea6854342db4240f830c433a8fcb4",
